.SYNOPSIS
    This PowerShell script ensures that the maximum size of the Windows Application event log 
    is at least 32768 KB (32 MB).

.NOTES
    Author          : Juan Saravia
    LinkedIn        : https://www.linkedin.com/in/juan-francisco-saravia-300634233/
    GitHub          : https://github.com/jfsaravia
    Date Created    : 2025-09-15
